{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/0d4f15a82a0aea4758b8ff9795b2f5ae.poster.avif?t=1761762560\" width=670 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/0d4f15a82a0aea4758b8ff9795b2f5ae.webm?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/0d4f15a82a0aea4758b8ff9795b2f5ae.mp4?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVERCORE HEROES: ASCENSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascension is a Hero Roguelite</strong> where each character leans into a totally different playstyle for you to master! Each run is a high-stakes gauntlet of enemies, strategy, and role mastery. Fall, rise stronger, and protect the Evercore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND THE EVERCORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Luum Sentinel</strong>, you are one of the last heroes standing against Fate\u2019s Blade, a sinister force seeking to corrupt Lumerea\u2019s magic. The Evercore, a source of balance and life, has been shattered, and only by recovering its fragments can you restore order before chaos takes hold!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/2046773c7bbf3f2a7a9635c9582d47d0.avif?t=1761762560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras_big/2046773c7bbf3f2a7a9635c9582d47d0.webp?t=1761762560 width=1560 height=105 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/09d7f07b9934c087aa3c2d47f9c45f56.poster.avif?t=1761762560\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/09d7f07b9934c087aa3c2d47f9c45f56.webm?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/09d7f07b9934c087aa3c2d47f9c45f56.mp4?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MISSIONS, ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Launch from Castle Everae into procedural missions</strong> full of deadly monsters, layered objectives, and intense boss fights. Go on <strong>strike missions</strong> and experience tight 30-minute adventures or go all the way and face the full experience in <strong>adventure mode!</strong> Each run is different and every decision counts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/d901d1d7d2cd8f6d6a443e2fa8da03f5.avif?t=1761762560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras_big/d901d1d7d2cd8f6d6a443e2fa8da03f5.avif?t=1761762560 width=800 height=62 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/98588881702074d0d3a0de8eec9a1ce0.poster.avif?t=1761762560\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/98588881702074d0d3a0de8eec9a1ce0.webm?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/98588881702074d0d3a0de8eec9a1ce0.mp4?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER UNIQUE HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and refine a roster of <strong>7 class-based Heroes</strong> - <strong>Tank, Damage, and Support</strong> - each with distinct powers, playstyles, and bold personalities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/7daa5b534e6fc95590381b2e383377d1.avif?t=1761762560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras_big/7daa5b534e6fc95590381b2e383377d1.avif?t=1761762560 width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/8077a58a47e217aa1671dc67e481fc26.poster.avif?t=1761762560\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/8077a58a47e217aa1671dc67e481fc26.webm?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/8077a58a47e217aa1671dc67e481fc26.mp4?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your role and <strong>break the meta</strong> with <strong>Shards</strong> - in-run, game-changing upgrades that reshape your build and let you adapt your Hero in powerful new ways. Experiment, refine, and surprise the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/fcdbe1fd12dd885d32570dc14081b915.avif?t=1761762560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras_big/fcdbe1fd12dd885d32570dc14081b915.avif?t=1761762560 width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/c13c3cab56471bc3fd89b8a1665e27fd.poster.avif?t=1761762560\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/c13c3cab56471bc3fd89b8a1665e27fd.webm?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/c13c3cab56471bc3fd89b8a1665e27fd.mp4?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress persists</strong>. Unlock <strong>Core Powers</strong>\u2014meta progression that strengthens your Heroes between runs to go further each time. Victory or defeat, you're always advancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/fbba6eec543db52dc8a1694ee59ed416.avif?t=1761762560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras_big/fbba6eec543db52dc8a1694ee59ed416.avif?t=1761762560 width=800 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/2359cbfe9ea652259f55a7d9630312ee.poster.avif?t=1761762560\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/2359cbfe9ea652259f55a7d9630312ee.webm?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/2359cbfe9ea652259f55a7d9630312ee.mp4?t=1761762560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A LIVING SCIENCE-FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the <strong>Realms of Lumerea</strong> and climb the frozen peaks, venture the wide tundra and explore the deep mines of Kru. <strong>Discover a world full of danger, beauty, and hidden stories!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally your team, embrace the challenge, and become the heroes Lumerea needs!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2586780?t=1761762560","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761762560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/68ba02f20afc7a373846980aa949d7038aa62846/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761762560","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/68ba02f20afc7a373846980aa949d7038aa62846/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761762560","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/0d4f15a82a0aea4758b8ff9795b2f5ae.poster.avif?t=1761762560\" width=670 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstat